  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "きあいを　たかめて　こんしんの　ちからを\nほうしゅつする。あいての　とくぼうを\nさげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "기합을 높여서\n혼신의 힘을 방출한다. 상대의\n특수방어를 떨어뜨릴 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提高氣勢，\n釋放全身所有力量。\n有時會降低對手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur rassemble ses forces et laisse éclater\nson pouvoir. Peut aussi baisser la Défense Spéciale\nde l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender erhöht seinen mentalen Fokus und greift\ndann an. Senkt eventuell Spezial-Verteidigung des\nZieles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Agudiza la concentración mental y libera su poder.\nPuede disminuir la Defensa Especial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si concentra e rilascia la sua forza.\nPuò ridurre la Difesa Speciale del Pokémon colpito.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user heightens its mental focus and unleashes\nits power. This may also lower the target’s\nSp. Def stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "気合を　高めて\nありったけの　力を　放出する。\n相手の　特防を　さげることが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提高气势，\n释放出全部力量。\n有时会降低对手的特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Agudiza la concentración mental y libera su poder.\nPuede disminuir la Defensa Especial del objetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
